codex
The implementation now batches same-shaped hidden matrices through the five-step Newton–Schulz iteration, uses Nesterov-style momentum 0.95, and leaves embeddings/head on fused AdamW. Static checks pass; I’m committing this as one isolated optimizer experiment.
